(3660434, 511729, 77958, '<td valign="top">Very nicely framed.  The tilt of the head, the position of the hand and the rose all make for a very pleasing composition.<br/> <br/>I wish the image were a bit sharper though.  The overall color of the picture also looks muted and a bit dull to me - especially the flower.</td>', 'Very nicely framed.  The tilt of the head, the position of the hand and the rose all make for a very pleasing composition. I wish the image were a bit sharper though.  The overall color of the picture also looks muted and a bit dull to me - especially the flower.', '2007-05-17 15:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660437, 510740, 77958, '<td valign="top">Nice time lapse on the waves and an interesting sky.  I''m not fussy on the overall blue cast though.</td>', 'Nice time lapse on the waves and an interesting sky.  I''m not fussy on the overall blue cast though.', '2007-05-17 15:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660442, 510997, 77958, '<td valign="top">The overall all color tones are rather dark and dull.  The image isn''t quite sharp enough as well.  I like the shape and contour of the necklace though.</td>', 'The overall all color tones are rather dark and dull.  The image isn''t quite sharp enough as well.  I like the shape and contour of the necklace though.', '2007-05-17 15:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660447, 512562, 77958, '<td valign="top">Lacking a bit in sharpness.  The lighting treatment doesn''t really flatter the subject to its best advantage.  I like the use of a black background.  It really makes the dress stand out.</td>', 'Lacking a bit in sharpness.  The lighting treatment doesn''t really flatter the subject to its best advantage.  I like the use of a black background.  It really makes the dress stand out.', '2007-05-17 15:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660459, 512771, 77958, '<td valign="top">I like the overall composition.<br/> <br/>Not clear though on what message the models expression is supposed to convey to the viewer.<br/> <br/>I''m also not fond on the shadow on the wall - it''s a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'I like the overall composition. Not clear though on what message the models expression is supposed to convey to the viewer. I''m also not fond on the shadow on the wall - it''s a bit of a distraction.', '2007-05-17 15:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660471, 512295, 77958, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter.  The deep orange shade of the flower plays nicely against the black seeds.<br/> <br/>The image need a bit more sharpening though and I''m thinking another shot at reframing the image might help the pictures overall strength and impact.</td>', 'I like the subject matter.  The deep orange shade of the flower plays nicely against the black seeds. The image need a bit more sharpening though and I''m thinking another shot at reframing the image might help the pictures overall strength and impact.', '2007-05-17 15:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660482, 512346, 77958, '<td valign="top">I like the way the car is angled, though I would have liked to have seen the front wheels turned a bit more to the left.<br/> <br/>There is some loss of detail in the heavy shadows just under the front bumper, also the sky is lacking a bit in punch.</td>', 'I like the way the car is angled, though I would have liked to have seen the front wheels turned a bit more to the left. There is some loss of detail in the heavy shadows just under the front bumper, also the sky is lacking a bit in punch.', '2007-05-17 15:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660490, 512486, 77958, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of water drops on the petals - they add some needed visual interest.<br/> <br/>A bit more of a punch in the color of the flower would give the image more impact.  More dof would also improve things a bit.  The image could also be reframed and shot from another angle.  I know it''s a flower from the description, but it''s not entirely clear by looking at the image what this is a picture of.</td>', 'I like the choice of water drops on the petals - they add some needed visual interest. A bit more of a punch in the color of the flower would give the image more impact.  More dof would also improve things a bit.  The image could also be reframed and shot from another angle.  I know it''s a flower from the description, but it''s not entirely clear by looking at the image what this is a picture of.', '2007-05-17 15:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660500, 512711, 77958, '<td valign="top">A little on the dark side in my opinion.  <br/> <br/>I like the level of blur, however it seems to be taken a bit to the extreme, coming across as a drawing rather than a photograph.</td>', 'A little on the dark side in my opinion.   I like the level of blur, however it seems to be taken a bit to the extreme, coming across as a drawing rather than a photograph.', '2007-05-17 15:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660504, 512329, 77958, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and vivid colors.  A sharper image would have helped things along.</td>', 'Nice detail and vivid colors.  A sharper image would have helped things along.', '2007-05-17 15:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
