(3660569, 512509, 59029, '<td valign="top">lots of potential here but the camera-mounted flash is unkind, gets too much glare off the pie plate in front (also oof) and an almost oily sheen to the chocolate.  a closer crop would likely have worked better too, the whisk and double cream detract.  Still very good idea, just get more dof and in closer.  Lots of chocolate in this challenge, look at similar pics.  good luck! :-)</td>', 'lots of potential here but the camera-mounted flash is unkind, gets too much glare off the pie plate in front (also oof) and an almost oily sheen to the chocolate.  a closer crop would likely have worked better too, the whisk and double cream detract.  Still very good idea, just get more dof and in closer.  Lots of chocolate in this challenge, look at similar pics.  good luck! :-)', '2007-05-17 16:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
