(3660763, 512830, 61651, '<td valign="top">The softer focus works well for the subject and I like how you''ve got an asymmetrical arrangement of petals in the composition.  Nicely shot.</td>', 'The softer focus works well for the subject and I like how you''ve got an asymmetrical arrangement of petals in the composition.  Nicely shot.', '2007-05-17 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660768, 512130, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like how the motion blur here gives a feathery look to the composition overall.  Great attempt to show silky/smooth where we might not normally see it.</td>', 'I like how the motion blur here gives a feathery look to the composition overall.  Great attempt to show silky/smooth where we might not normally see it.', '2007-05-17 17:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
