(3660775, 512879, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very cool image, very pretty.  Good choice of subject - this would not have worked so well if the leaves were more solidly shaped, less wispy.  The frilly/wispy shape of the leaves gives the image it''s "silky" look, IMO.</td>', 'Very cool image, very pretty.  Good choice of subject - this would not have worked so well if the leaves were more solidly shaped, less wispy.  The frilly/wispy shape of the leaves gives the image it''s "silky" look, IMO.', '2007-05-17 17:28:55.000000', NULL, 1);
