(3662654, 512003, 77958, '<td valign="top">A very nice image.  The soft focus compliments the subject matter, though I would have liked to have seen the center of the flower a bit sharper.</td>', 'A very nice image.  The soft focus compliments the subject matter, though I would have liked to have seen the center of the flower a bit sharper.', '2007-05-18 08:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662660, 511756, 77958, '<td valign="top">I find the color and lacklustre lighting overwhelms the photograph, as well the focus is a bit scatter shot and not well defined.  <br/> <br/>I like the choice of subject matter - the different visual textures of the flower are very eye-catching.</td>', 'I find the color and lacklustre lighting overwhelms the photograph, as well the focus is a bit scatter shot and not well defined.   I like the choice of subject matter - the different visual textures of the flower are very eye-catching.', '2007-05-18 08:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662667, 512826, 77958, '<td valign="top">The subject matter is very engaging.  His pose and facial expression are wonderful. I wish the eyes were in sharper focus though, and I''m not a fan of the background in this image - it''s distracting and look poorly post processed.</td>', 'The subject matter is very engaging.  His pose and facial expression are wonderful. I wish the eyes were in sharper focus though, and I''m not a fan of the background in this image - it''s distracting and look poorly post processed.', '2007-05-18 08:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662677, 510276, 77958, '<td valign="top">An engaging use of shadow.  A great job of controlling the amount of noise as well, especially considering the dark environment.  The only thing I don''t like is how the elbow is clipped on the left hand side - I would rather see the entire arm, with an appropriate amount of empty space between the statue and the left edge of the frame.</td>', 'An engaging use of shadow.  A great job of controlling the amount of noise as well, especially considering the dark environment.  The only thing I don''t like is how the elbow is clipped on the left hand side - I would rather see the entire arm, with an appropriate amount of empty space between the statue and the left edge of the frame.', '2007-05-18 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662684, 512365, 77958, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrasting colors.  I like the soft focus on the stem.  The actual bloom looks a bit on the noisey side to my eye and the stamin could be just a touch sharper.</td>', 'Very nice contrasting colors.  I like the soft focus on the stem.  The actual bloom looks a bit on the noisey side to my eye and the stamin could be just a touch sharper.', '2007-05-18 08:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662687, 512297, 77958, '<td valign="top">The rocks offer some interesting texture to the photo, but there isn''t a clearly defined subject in the image on which to focus the viewers attention.  The overall focus could be sharper as well.</td>', 'The rocks offer some interesting texture to the photo, but there isn''t a clearly defined subject in the image on which to focus the viewers attention.  The overall focus could be sharper as well.', '2007-05-18 08:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662697, 509729, 77958, '<td valign="top">A very attractive choice of flower.  The varying degrees of direct lighting and shadow play an interesting contrast, however the light level between the two is a bit too severe.  A better choice in treating the background could also improve the image - while an indistinct backdrop makes a photo interesting in this case I don''t have a clear idea what the background is (I think it''s running water?)</td>', 'A very attractive choice of flower.  The varying degrees of direct lighting and shadow play an interesting contrast, however the light level between the two is a bit too severe.  A better choice in treating the background could also improve the image - while an indistinct backdrop makes a photo interesting in this case I don''t have a clear idea what the background is (I think it''s running water?)', '2007-05-18 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662704, 511593, 77958, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color contrasts.  A bit on the underexposed side.</td>', 'Nice composition and color contrasts.  A bit on the underexposed side.', '2007-05-18 08:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662711, 510473, 77958, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, though, I would have liked to have seen the bottom petal of the yellow flower not cut off by the bottom of the image frame.  The overall focus is off as well and could be sharper.   I like the color of the flowers as well the visual arc formed by the flowers as your eye moves through the image starting at the bottom and ending at the top middle of the frame.</td>', 'Nicely framed, though, I would have liked to have seen the bottom petal of the yellow flower not cut off by the bottom of the image frame.  The overall focus is off as well and could be sharper.   I like the color of the flowers as well the visual arc formed by the flowers as your eye moves through the image starting at the bottom and ending at the top middle of the frame.', '2007-05-18 08:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662718, 510717, 77958, '<td valign="top">Interesting color contrast.  The color saturation of the bloom could be toned down just a notch.</td>', 'Interesting color contrast.  The color saturation of the bloom could be toned down just a notch.', '2007-05-18 08:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662722, 512830, 77958, '<td valign="top">A little on the underexposed side and the focus doesn''t flatter the image to its full advantage.  The flower also looks past its prime.</td>', 'A little on the underexposed side and the focus doesn''t flatter the image to its full advantage.  The flower also looks past its prime.', '2007-05-18 08:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662728, 512490, 77958, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a fish look angry :-)  Nice composition and color contrasts.  The lillies look a bit oversharpened to my eye.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a fish look angry :-)  Nice composition and color contrasts.  The lillies look a bit oversharpened to my eye.', '2007-05-18 08:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662731, 512687, 77958, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of framing, however I would like to have seen the entire flower fall within the interior red rectangular boundary.</td>', 'I like the choice of framing, however I would like to have seen the entire flower fall within the interior red rectangular boundary.', '2007-05-18 08:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662740, 511375, 77958, '<td valign="top">Very nice smile (though a little soft) and I like the framing of the shot.  The background also really suits the image.  The pose doesn''t look entirely natural to my eye.  The position of the hands perhaps?  The flexion of the left wrist?</td>', 'Very nice smile (though a little soft) and I like the framing of the shot.  The background also really suits the image.  The pose doesn''t look entirely natural to my eye.  The position of the hands perhaps?  The flexion of the left wrist?', '2007-05-18 08:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662744, 512353, 77958, '<td valign="top">Neat :-)</td>', 'Neat :-)', '2007-05-18 08:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662747, 512810, 77958, '<td valign="top">I like the image, though I find there are too many visual focal points.  My eye is drawn all over the photo in a random manner as each bloom competes for my attention.</td>', 'I like the image, though I find there are too many visual focal points.  My eye is drawn all over the photo in a random manner as each bloom competes for my attention.', '2007-05-18 08:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662759, 512529, 77958, '<td valign="top">A very striking and engaging pose - almost magazine quality in my opinion.  The lighting choice doesn''t flatter the subject matter to its full advantage though and the hand looks soft.  The specular highlight in the middle far left is also a bit of a distraction.  The dress is also chopped off prematurely on the right hand side of the image.<br/> <br/>With a bit more attention to the above - particular the lighting - I think this photo has the potential to be resubmitted in a future challenge and garner a solid 10.</td>', 'A very striking and engaging pose - almost magazine quality in my opinion.  The lighting choice doesn''t flatter the subject matter to its full advantage though and the hand looks soft.  The specular highlight in the middle far left is also a bit of a distraction.  The dress is also chopped off prematurely on the right hand side of the image. With a bit more attention to the above - particular the lighting - I think this photo has the potential to be resubmitted in a future challenge and garner a solid 10.', '2007-05-18 09:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662762, 512027, 77958, '<td valign="top">A nice composition.  The colors are a bit on the dull side though.</td>', 'A nice composition.  The colors are a bit on the dull side though.', '2007-05-18 09:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662766, 511806, 77958, '<td valign="top">An interesting "product shot" like image.  The focus could be a bit more consistant from foreground to background.  Also, the flash produced a reflection in the foreground bottle and created shadows which don''t necessarily flatter the image.</td>', 'An interesting "product shot" like image.  The focus could be a bit more consistant from foreground to background.  Also, the flash produced a reflection in the foreground bottle and created shadows which don''t necessarily flatter the image.', '2007-05-18 09:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662773, 510156, 77958, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and facial expression - I especially like the slight tilt of the head and the way she''s engaging the camera with her gaze.  There are quite a few blown highlights though which detract from an overall nice portrait.</td>', 'Nice pose and facial expression - I especially like the slight tilt of the head and the way she''s engaging the camera with her gaze.  There are quite a few blown highlights though which detract from an overall nice portrait.', '2007-05-18 09:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662778, 512808, 77958, '<td valign="top">Very cute!<br/> <br/>I would have considered cropping in a lot tighter when producing the final image - there are a lot of other elements competing for attention other than the squirrel is this wonderful image.</td>', 'Very cute! I would have considered cropping in a lot tighter when producing the final image - there are a lot of other elements competing for attention other than the squirrel is this wonderful image.', '2007-05-18 09:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662782, 512016, 78388, '<td valign="top">- Subject clipped, composition problems<br/>- Subject not sharp or out of focus<br/>- Harsh reflections from flash or lighting</td>', '- Subject clipped, composition problems- Subject not sharp or out of focus- Harsh reflections from flash or lighting', '2007-05-18 09:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662785, 511312, 77958, '<td valign="top">The eyelashes are amaaaaazing - sharp, textured and well lit.  I might have considered other angles and composition options for the photo though - I like the choice of including the arm in the photo, however I think there''s too much chest in the photo - it reads as a solid surface and one which competes for attention with the subject of the photo.</td>', 'The eyelashes are amaaaaazing - sharp, textured and well lit.  I might have considered other angles and composition options for the photo though - I like the choice of including the arm in the photo, however I think there''s too much chest in the photo - it reads as a solid surface and one which competes for attention with the subject of the photo.', '2007-05-18 09:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662787, 510963, 78388, '<td valign="top">- Link to challenge is perhaps too vague (is the link the child''s skin, or his pose?)</td>', '- Link to challenge is perhaps too vague (is the link the child''s skin, or his pose?)', '2007-05-18 09:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662790, 510704, 78388, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I''m not convinced by the composition.  A little more engineering of how the duvet fell might improve the picture?</td>', 'I like the idea, but I''m not convinced by the composition.  A little more engineering of how the duvet fell might improve the picture?', '2007-05-18 09:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662792, 511954, 77958, '<td valign="top">To me this photo cries out for sharp focus from front to back - something it lacks.  I love the idea and the composition though.  The use of flash adds some nice texture to the strawberry, but it also left reflections throughout the image which distract from the overall photo.  <br/> <br/>I think you have a winner here, but it just needs some retooling - shoot with a tripod and no flash perhaps in a well lit area?  Use a bounce flash?</td>', 'To me this photo cries out for sharp focus from front to back - something it lacks.  I love the idea and the composition though.  The use of flash adds some nice texture to the strawberry, but it also left reflections throughout the image which distract from the overall photo.   I think you have a winner here, but it just needs some retooling - shoot with a tripod and no flash perhaps in a well lit area?  Use a bounce flash?', '2007-05-18 09:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662795, 511722, 77958, '<td valign="top">I like the model and the pose.  The shadows on her face are a bit of a distraction.  I''d also put more of her left hand into the frame.</td>', 'I like the model and the pose.  The shadows on her face are a bit of a distraction.  I''d also put more of her left hand into the frame.', '2007-05-18 09:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662808, 512778, 77958, '<td valign="top">Like the image, though I don''t particularly like the background</td>', 'Like the image, though I don''t particularly like the background', '2007-05-18 09:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662820, 511748, 77958, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the sheet at the black lattice work.  There''s a bit too much foreground (the sheets) and not enough background in my opinion.  The foreground overwhelms the composition.  I would try reframing the shot, leaving out any hints of the matress and including more of the headboard - 3/4 sheets, 1/4 headboard perhaps?</td>', 'Nice contrast between the sheet at the black lattice work.  There''s a bit too much foreground (the sheets) and not enough background in my opinion.  The foreground overwhelms the composition.  I would try reframing the shot, leaving out any hints of the matress and including more of the headboard - 3/4 sheets, 1/4 headboard perhaps?', '2007-05-18 09:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662822, 509937, 78388, '<td valign="top">It''s been done many times before - but I really like this smoke pic, particularly because it fits the smooth challenge title so well and the composition is better than most.</td>', 'It''s been done many times before - but I really like this smoke pic, particularly because it fits the smooth challenge title so well and the composition is better than most.', '2007-05-18 09:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3662846, 512509, 78388, '<td valign="top">I think the flash probably ruined the atmosphere in this pic.<br/> <br/>A shallower depth of field and better angle could have brought more out of the subject imo.</td>', 'I think the flash probably ruined the atmosphere in this pic. A shallower depth of field and better angle could have brought more out of the subject imo.', '2007-05-18 09:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
