(3664390, 512675, 66597, '<td valign="top">You get kudos just for that funny title :-) Having picked up many snakes (I''m a big fan) I agree that they are suprisingly soft and silky to the touch! I think this is a great entry, though I''m sure you''ll get dinged by people who don''t realize how nice the skin of the snake really is.</td>', 'You get kudos just for that funny title :-) Having picked up many snakes (I''m a big fan) I agree that they are suprisingly soft and silky to the touch! I think this is a great entry, though I''m sure you''ll get dinged by people who don''t realize how nice the skin of the snake really is.', '2007-05-18 19:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3664393, 512197, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like how you posed her on the rough bark for contrast. Very well done. 9.</td>', 'I like how you posed her on the rough bark for contrast. Very well done. 9.', '2007-05-18 19:28:37.000000', NULL, 1);
