(3664681, 510656, 46598, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but it needs quite a fair bit of help in the post processing. After levels, saturation and colour selection to bring out the green and the fiber this photo would be really cool! ...but for now it''s a bit dull. :(</td>', 'Great photo, but it needs quite a fair bit of help in the post processing. After levels, saturation and colour selection to bring out the green and the fiber this photo would be really cool! ...but for now it''s a bit dull. :(', '2007-05-18 21:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
