(3665607, 511792, 78196, '<td valign="top">Personally, I don''t like the way that almost everyone seems to put ''smooth and silky'' in their title, as though to try and justify that their shot belongs in the challenge, which in the case of this superb photo is completely unnecessary. It must have been very difficult to capture the horse in motion in this way, and the sunlight coming off its body creates a great effect.</td>', 'Personally, I don''t like the way that almost everyone seems to put ''smooth and silky'' in their title, as though to try and justify that their shot belongs in the challenge, which in the case of this superb photo is completely unnecessary. It must have been very difficult to capture the horse in motion in this way, and the sunlight coming off its body creates a great effect.', '2007-05-19 06:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
