(3666465, 512899, 60173, '<td valign="top">Your trees look very strange. Is that a sharpening glow? The right half of the photo is beautiful though.</td>', 'Your trees look very strange. Is that a sharpening glow? The right half of the photo is beautiful though.', '2007-05-19 14:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666472, 512441, 60173, '<td valign="top">That water droplet is so perfect I''m inclined to say it''s fake. If it''s fake then the photo isn''t all that great, because it''s the water drop that''s making the photo. If it''s real there''s a wow factor. I''m torn. I know I should assume it''s real and vote accordingly. Hmmmmmmmmm...</td>', 'That water droplet is so perfect I''m inclined to say it''s fake. If it''s fake then the photo isn''t all that great, because it''s the water drop that''s making the photo. If it''s real there''s a wow factor. I''m torn. I know I should assume it''s real and vote accordingly. Hmmmmmmmmm...', '2007-05-19 14:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666480, 512827, 60173, '<td valign="top">I would actually like this more without the bird. The water and plants have a great texture to them and great colors. The focus wasn''t dead on with the bird and I think that''s what is hurting the photo as a whole.</td>', 'I would actually like this more without the bird. The water and plants have a great texture to them and great colors. The focus wasn''t dead on with the bird and I think that''s what is hurting the photo as a whole.', '2007-05-19 14:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666499, 511142, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''ll be perfectly honest here. She''s a beautiful girl, but my first thought was "shoplifter." I can''t even really explain why I thought that. I guess it sort of looks like a security camera photo. <br/> <br/>Pretty young teen + security camera = shoplifter<br/> <br/>The tones are very pleasant. I think if the background was less in focus and whatever is in the foreground wasn''t there, this could be a nice photo. Even without the foreground object this could be a lot better.</td>', 'I''ll be perfectly honest here. She''s a beautiful girl, but my first thought was "shoplifter." I can''t even really explain why I thought that. I guess it sort of looks like a security camera photo.  Pretty young teen + security camera = shoplifter The tones are very pleasant. I think if the background was less in focus and whatever is in the foreground wasn''t there, this could be a nice photo. Even without the foreground object this could be a lot better.', '2007-05-19 14:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666513, 510156, 60173, '<td valign="top">This looks a touch over processed mainly in the hair. I also think a tighter crop would look better and bring her beautiful face closer (also eliminating some of the background stuff). She has a very pleasant facial expression. I can understand why you chose that title.</td>', 'This looks a touch over processed mainly in the hair. I also think a tighter crop would look better and bring her beautiful face closer (also eliminating some of the background stuff). She has a very pleasant facial expression. I can understand why you chose that title.', '2007-05-19 14:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666527, 512700, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m fighting the square crop on this. I really want to see the top of the bottle. Missing the bottom isn''t bothering me as much. I think the background glass should be a touch more in focus. You''re almost completely losing it in the backdrop. I understand that you want it out of focus, but I think you went a little too far with it. <br/> <br/>I think the background glass draws attention to the backdrop actually, and I''m not sold on your backdrop. Bringing that glass more in focus would help define it from your cloth.</td>', 'I''m fighting the square crop on this. I really want to see the top of the bottle. Missing the bottom isn''t bothering me as much. I think the background glass should be a touch more in focus. You''re almost completely losing it in the backdrop. I understand that you want it out of focus, but I think you went a little too far with it.  I think the background glass draws attention to the backdrop actually, and I''m not sold on your backdrop. Bringing that glass more in focus would help define it from your cloth.', '2007-05-19 14:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666531, 510992, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s simply not enough light on that honey. I like your background a lot though.</td>', 'There''s simply not enough light on that honey. I like your background a lot though.', '2007-05-19 14:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666532, 510862, 60173, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors, but you missed your focus spot.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors, but you missed your focus spot.', '2007-05-19 14:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666535, 509729, 77196, '<td valign="top">would have been better with a square crop.</td>', 'would have been better with a square crop.', '2007-05-19 14:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666537, 511756, 60173, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue and your focus seems to be alright. It''s just too dark.</td>', 'Beautiful blue and your focus seems to be alright. It''s just too dark.', '2007-05-19 14:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666538, 512486, 77196, '<td valign="top">Only thing in focus is the water droplets. Not enough of rose to identify it.</td>', 'Only thing in focus is the water droplets. Not enough of rose to identify it.', '2007-05-19 14:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666540, 512130, 77196, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge. Lots of blur. Picture lacks a focus.</td>', 'I think this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge. Lots of blur. Picture lacks a focus.', '2007-05-19 15:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666543, 512190, 77196, '<td valign="top">Picture lacks a focus and has nothing in focus. Bottom center is almost blown out.</td>', 'Picture lacks a focus and has nothing in focus. Bottom center is almost blown out.', '2007-05-19 15:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666547, 512353, 60173, '<td valign="top">I knew I was going to see one of these shots for this challenge, heh. I think you left your "milk shake" out too long. <br/> <br/>I''ve never tried a shot like this, but I''d imagine the focus is tough to nail. Unfortunately I don''t think you nailed it. The front bits are in focus, so it looks like a DOF issue. Which would mean you''d want a bigger aperture.. which means more light.. let there be more light!</td>', 'I knew I was going to see one of these shots for this challenge, heh. I think you left your "milk shake" out too long.  I''ve never tried a shot like this, but I''d imagine the focus is tough to nail. Unfortunately I don''t think you nailed it. The front bits are in focus, so it looks like a DOF issue. Which would mean you''d want a bigger aperture.. which means more light.. let there be more light!', '2007-05-19 15:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666550, 511328, 77196, '<td valign="top">Tulips are particularly difficult to shoot. For me, the center being out of focus (and being such a large part of the picture and the focal point) seriously detracts from this photo. I absolutely love the focus and shine on the tips of petals - it holds such promise...</td>', 'Tulips are particularly difficult to shoot. For me, the center being out of focus (and being such a large part of the picture and the focal point) seriously detracts from this photo. I absolutely love the focus and shine on the tips of petals - it holds such promise...', '2007-05-19 15:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666551, 511335, 60173, '<td valign="top">Just the soft fabric isn''t do it for me. This seems to be lacking a subject. I know the fabric is the subject, but it just doesn''t feel like it.</td>', 'Just the soft fabric isn''t do it for me. This seems to be lacking a subject. I know the fabric is the subject, but it just doesn''t feel like it.', '2007-05-19 15:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666554, 511735, 77196, '<td valign="top">You can call it silky and smooth, but it looks like a sunset to me.</td>', 'You can call it silky and smooth, but it looks like a sunset to me.', '2007-05-19 15:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666560, 512771, 60173, '<td valign="top">Very harsh shadow. Stepping away from the wall helps eliminate that I hear.<br/> <br/>Moving on.. I feel dirty.</td>', 'Very harsh shadow. Stepping away from the wall helps eliminate that I hear. Moving on.. I feel dirty.', '2007-05-19 15:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666563, 512197, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the rough wood and smooth skin. Arm in foreground is dark, and distracts from the shot. Post &amp; composition is unusual, but am not sure it is pleasing.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the rough wood and smooth skin. Arm in foreground is dark, and distracts from the shot. Post & composition is unusual, but am not sure it is pleasing.', '2007-05-19 15:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666566, 512808, 77196, '<td valign="top">Don''t you hate backgrounds? (I''m not taking off because of it, though...) Adorable, fun picture.</td>', 'Don''t you hate backgrounds? (I''m not taking off because of it, though...) Adorable, fun picture.', '2007-05-19 15:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666570, 512660, 60173, '<td valign="top">Firstly, she''s upside-down. Okay I guess that''s really all. It really bugs me that she''s upside-down.</td>', 'Firstly, she''s upside-down. Okay I guess that''s really all. It really bugs me that she''s upside-down.', '2007-05-19 15:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666573, 512266, 77196, '<td valign="top">Where is the whipped cream? Looks like it went away while you were trying to get your shot. Nice composition and tonal shades of white through brown.</td>', 'Where is the whipped cream? Looks like it went away while you were trying to get your shot. Nice composition and tonal shades of white through brown.', '2007-05-19 15:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666578, 512297, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure this meets silky or smooth.</td>', 'Not sure this meets silky or smooth.', '2007-05-19 15:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666584, 512808, 60173, '<td valign="top">lol I bet he''s got the comfiest little varmit home ever. I love his little tummy and how he''s perched there. <br/> <br/>I don''t see anything too technically wrong with this photo. Shots like these are just what they are; funny. I don''t think you''ll score all that well, mainly because this just isn''t what they''re looking for in a photo winner. You will however make hundreds of people laugh. I thank you for the laugh.<br/> <br/>=)</td>', 'lol I bet he''s got the comfiest little varmit home ever. I love his little tummy and how he''s perched there.  I don''t see anything too technically wrong with this photo. Shots like these are just what they are; funny. I don''t think you''ll score all that well, mainly because this just isn''t what they''re looking for in a photo winner. You will however make hundreds of people laugh. I thank you for the laugh. =)', '2007-05-19 15:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3666588, 512562, 60173, '<td valign="top">Since this is a staged still life photo, why didn''t you reshoot it to get the shoulders of the dress in the shot? I wonder if fashion photographers stuff the chest of dresses. Something about the sunken in chest area doesn''t work.</td>', 'Since this is a staged still life photo, why didn''t you reshoot it to get the shoulders of the dress in the shot? I wonder if fashion photographers stuff the chest of dresses. Something about the sunken in chest area doesn''t work.', '2007-05-19 15:21:46.000000', NULL, 1);
