(3669463, 512772, 76184, '<td valign="top">Tranquil, yes. Blue, check. Smooth...m''eh...makes me think wet, not smooth.<br/> <br/>Aside from the black thing out in the water, this is a perfect shot. I think this would have been a better fit for a texture challenge than a silky-smooth challenge. Nonetheless, I still like this photo. Tranquil is an apt description. 7</td>', 'Tranquil, yes. Blue, check. Smooth...m''eh...makes me think wet, not smooth. Aside from the black thing out in the water, this is a perfect shot. I think this would have been a better fit for a texture challenge than a silky-smooth challenge. Nonetheless, I still like this photo. Tranquil is an apt description. 7', '2007-05-20 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
