(3670596, 512353, 69102, '<td valign="top">While the timing of the capture is impressive, the coloring and the DOF make the overall impression of the shot into something rather unappetizing and unattractive.</td>', 'While the timing of the capture is impressive, the coloring and the DOF make the overall impression of the shot into something rather unappetizing and unattractive.', '2007-05-20 21:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
