(3672637, 510992, 17279, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the topic.  I''m not so sure I like the particular background you chose... it seems to me something ''smoother'' (and perhaps a different color) might have been more appropriate.  7</td>', 'Very nice take on the topic.  I''m not so sure I like the particular background you chose... it seems to me something ''smoother'' (and perhaps a different color) might have been more appropriate.  7', '2007-05-21 03:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672645, 512016, 17279, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is a bit harsh and detracts a bit from the image.  I do see where you were going with this though.</td>', 'The lighting here is a bit harsh and detracts a bit from the image.  I do see where you were going with this though.', '2007-05-21 03:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672648, 512509, 17279, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but the lighting is a bit strong and the cream container in the background draws your attention away from the subject.</td>', 'Good concept, but the lighting is a bit strong and the cream container in the background draws your attention away from the subject.', '2007-05-21 03:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672657, 511828, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice job on this.  I would like to see a tighter crop on the actual chocolate without the wrapper in the image (or perhaps just a slight edge of the wrapper showing).  8</td>', 'Nice job on this.  I would like to see a tighter crop on the actual chocolate without the wrapper in the image (or perhaps just a slight edge of the wrapper showing).  8', '2007-05-21 03:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672663, 509966, 17279, '<td valign="top">I think I would have chosen some other item to pour it over.  The hand just doesn''t add anything to the image.</td>', 'I think I would have chosen some other item to pour it over.  The hand just doesn''t add anything to the image.', '2007-05-21 03:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672669, 512675, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Love the lines and colors.  The one thing that really strikes me is the DOF is a bit too shallow, leaving some parts out of focus.  I think this would be better if the entire snake was in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice image.  Love the lines and colors.  The one thing that really strikes me is the DOF is a bit too shallow, leaving some parts out of focus.  I think this would be better if the entire snake was in sharp focus.', '2007-05-21 03:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672678, 511623, 17279, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the ''silky smooth'' feeling from this image; it seems a bit too cluttered.  Also, I don''t particularly care for the B&amp;W treatment on this image.</td>', 'I don''t get the ''silky smooth'' feeling from this image; it seems a bit too cluttered.  Also, I don''t particularly care for the B&W treatment on this image.', '2007-05-21 03:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672682, 512197, 17279, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on this, and I like the contrast between the smoothness of her skin and the rought texture on the log.  You brought it out quite well. 9</td>', 'Very nice lighting on this, and I like the contrast between the smoothness of her skin and the rought texture on the log.  You brought it out quite well. 9', '2007-05-21 03:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
