(3679214, 512108, 24073, '<td valign="top">This is really borderline.  I do think it meets the challenge, and the play on light seems alright.  I just think its to obvious, and too blatent.  I think it would score better if you took another angle.</td>', 'This is really borderline.  I do think it meets the challenge, and the play on light seems alright.  I just think its to obvious, and too blatent.  I think it would score better if you took another angle.', '2007-05-22 11:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
