(3679284, 512725, 24073, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous model, and there is no doubt in my mind that if you score above avg. it will be on her looks alone.  Photographically you could do better. A more dramatic lighting set-up would help.<br/> <br/>The model did a great job.  Her posture, her make-up, her hair, and the stunning gaze seem right on key.  If this scores low, don''t let go of the idea, re-shoot it I think your on to something awesome here, its just a couple steps away.  GL.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous model, and there is no doubt in my mind that if you score above avg. it will be on her looks alone.  Photographically you could do better. A more dramatic lighting set-up would help. The model did a great job.  Her posture, her make-up, her hair, and the stunning gaze seem right on key.  If this scores low, don''t let go of the idea, re-shoot it I think your on to something awesome here, its just a couple steps away.  GL.', '2007-05-22 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
