(3680083, 512441, 30049, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!  10 from me.  I need to try one of these at some point, they are so cool!!!  You''ve captured the sphere perfectly.  Tack sharp.  The background blur and colors are outstanding.  Wow!  Did I mention I like this yet?  :D  I look forward to seeing this on the front page tomorrow morning.<br/> <br/>BTW - If you''re wondering why your score didn''t move after this...I voted several days ago.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!  10 from me.  I need to try one of these at some point, they are so cool!!!  You''ve captured the sphere perfectly.  Tack sharp.  The background blur and colors are outstanding.  Wow!  Did I mention I like this yet?  :D  I look forward to seeing this on the front page tomorrow morning. BTW - If you''re wondering why your score didn''t move after this...I voted several days ago.', '2007-05-22 14:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680094, 509937, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a LOT of smoke shots here over the last few years.  This one is superbly done!  Great job!  The lines are quite alluring, guiding the viewer gently thru the image to be ultimately lost in the ending curls of smoke.<br/> <br/>This should be displayed proudly on the front page tomorrow!!!  Well done.</td>', 'I''ve seen a LOT of smoke shots here over the last few years.  This one is superbly done!  Great job!  The lines are quite alluring, guiding the viewer gently thru the image to be ultimately lost in the ending curls of smoke. This should be displayed proudly on the front page tomorrow!!!  Well done.', '2007-05-22 14:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
