(3683693, 512016, 76430, '<td valign="top">I missed the brown ribbon by one.  I didn''t think it was that bad.  The picture was taken in a restaurant, so I was pretty limited in lighting capabilities, but maybe one I took without flash but brightened in editing would have worked better.  Soon I hope to get a better camera to work with other than my camcorder.</td>', 'I missed the brown ribbon by one.  I didn''t think it was that bad.  The picture was taken in a restaurant, so I was pretty limited in lighting capabilities, but maybe one I took without flash but brightened in editing would have worked better.  Soon I hope to get a better camera to work with other than my camcorder.', '2007-05-23 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
