(3683723, 510992, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow, Jared. Welcome to DPC and congrats on a great image and score!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-23 01:03:18.</i></td>', 'Wow, Jared. Welcome to DPC and congrats on a great image and score!', '2007-05-23 02:03:02.000000', '2007-05-23 02:03:18.000000', 0),
(3683727, 511542, 5792, '<td valign="top">What an amazing capture. Beautiful in every way. A fine technical achievement as well. It may have scored only 5.8 but if I could capture and process an image as good as this I''d be thrilled. Obviously you got a 10 from me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-23 01:04:04.</i></td>', 'What an amazing capture. Beautiful in every way. A fine technical achievement as well. It may have scored only 5.8 but if I could capture and process an image as good as this I''d be thrilled. Obviously you got a 10 from me.', '2007-05-23 02:03:23.000000', '2007-05-23 02:04:04.000000', 0),
(3683736, 512345, 74209, '<td valign="top">You are all so encouraging to me as I am a newcomer to this community and have so much to learn!  I used my 75-300 lens, and so during the shooting missed the dirt, which I was unable to clone out later due to basic editing rules.  I was paranoid about it during the voting, and really amazed that almost everyone seemed to focus on the lovlier aspects.  Thanks again for so many constructive comments and for a PB on this my third challenge!</td>', 'You are all so encouraging to me as I am a newcomer to this community and have so much to learn!  I used my 75-300 lens, and so during the shooting missed the dirt, which I was unable to clone out later due to basic editing rules.  I was paranoid about it during the voting, and really amazed that almost everyone seemed to focus on the lovlier aspects.  Thanks again for so many constructive comments and for a PB on this my third challenge!', '2007-05-23 02:04:50.000000', NULL, 0),
