(3684091, 512106, 50641, '<td valign="top">This was an 8 from me.  Beautiful abstract.  I wonder if a gaussian blur or a bucket of neat image might have made this look even silkier...?  Though I kind of like being able to see the dots clearly.  Nice bold entry!</td>', 'This was an 8 from me.  Beautiful abstract.  I wonder if a gaussian blur or a bucket of neat image might have made this look even silkier...?  Though I kind of like being able to see the dots clearly.  Nice bold entry!', '2007-05-23 03:55:28.000000', NULL, 0),
