(3684108, 511335, 50641, '<td valign="top">I think the folds and the color really impart a luxurious, silky feel to the shot.  It''s great as an abstract.  Possibly a little gaussian blur or neat image would have made it smoother, but I kind of like the way the texture has a shine of its own.  Your lighting is fabulous. Congrats on a new top fiver :)</td>', 'I think the folds and the color really impart a luxurious, silky feel to the shot.  It''s great as an abstract.  Possibly a little gaussian blur or neat image would have made it smoother, but I kind of like the way the texture has a shine of its own.  Your lighting is fabulous. Congrats on a new top fiver :)', '2007-05-23 04:05:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3684118, 511335, 65713, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot, great job with the lighting. <br/>*I did a similar texture shot with patterned silk but gave up on the refolding a bit too soon and the result wasn''t as luxurious.</td>', 'I liked this shot, great job with the lighting. *I did a similar texture shot with patterned silk but gave up on the refolding a bit too soon and the result wasn''t as luxurious.', '2007-05-23 04:13:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3684121, 512771, 50641, '<td valign="top">I think that this would have done better if it weren''t for that title.  It makes a viewer kinda uncomfortable ;-)  It''s a fine, thoughtful pose and ties are indeed silky smooth.  The shadow is definitely funky but it''s interesting the way it makes you look like a cutout.  The tones and colors here make for a good, natural-looking portrait.  Keep shooting and keep up the humor  - just don''t scare us with our own thoughts anymore, ok?   ;-)</td>', 'I think that this would have done better if it weren''t for that title.  It makes a viewer kinda uncomfortable ;-)  It''s a fine, thoughtful pose and ties are indeed silky smooth.  The shadow is definitely funky but it''s interesting the way it makes you look like a cutout.  The tones and colors here make for a good, natural-looking portrait.  Keep shooting and keep up the humor  - just don''t scare us with our own thoughts anymore, ok?   ;-)', '2007-05-23 04:14:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3684127, 511198, 50641, '<td valign="top">You are like a big vat full of creative juices!  This was so close - it''s only the darn basic editing that let you down.  It looks simply amazing in thumbnail. You got a 9 from me. I will be looking forward to your future entries!</td>', 'You are like a big vat full of creative juices!  This was so close - it''s only the darn basic editing that let you down.  It looks simply amazing in thumbnail. You got a 9 from me. I will be looking forward to your future entries!', '2007-05-23 04:20:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3684166, 512441, 68887, '<td valign="top">congratulations :) really good start</td>', 'congratulations :) really good start', '2007-05-23 04:51:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3684182, 512441, 61045, '<td valign="top">What was used for the ''water''?  It''s too spherical to be water, IMHO.  Love the shot though.</td>', 'What was used for the ''water''?  It''s too spherical to be water, IMHO.  Love the shot though.', '2007-05-23 05:13:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3684192, 509937, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice smooth shot. Congrats on your Yellow.</td>', 'Nice smooth shot. Congrats on your Yellow.', '2007-05-23 05:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3684193, 512353, 23430, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot. Congrats.</td>', 'Amazing shot. Congrats.', '2007-05-23 05:31:39.000000', NULL, 0),
