(3684381, 511643, 40797, '<td valign="top">Annie -this is just beautiful!! I Love the silkiness of the water, the reflectiion of the lotus, the rich colors(the pink is so so pretty) and how crystal clear and in focus this is.<br/>Not a bad score for your first entry!! You did GREAT!!</td>', 'Annie -this is just beautiful!! I Love the silkiness of the water, the reflectiion of the lotus, the rich colors(the pink is so so pretty) and how crystal clear and in focus this is.Not a bad score for your first entry!! You did GREAT!!', '2007-05-23 07:21:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3684405, 512441, 78528, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much!!!I really don''t thought that I can win!!! Yay!<br/> <br/>Now, for everywhone, who think that it''s marble, too round to be droplets, too edited or sth I announce that I''m takeing droplets phtos for one year and I know how to get round droplet, we need 2 things : flower with silky-smooth petal, and syringe with needle. The droplet must be very very small to be so round. I''ve send my proof - oryginal photo, hope you belive me :)<br/> <br/>Thanks a lot for nice comments and so many votes !!!</td>', 'Thank you so much!!!I really don''t thought that I can win!!! Yay! Now, for everywhone, who think that it''s marble, too round to be droplets, too edited or sth I announce that I''m takeing droplets phtos for one year and I know how to get round droplet, we need 2 things : flower with silky-smooth petal, and syringe with needle. The droplet must be very very small to be so round. I''ve send my proof - oryginal photo, hope you belive me :) Thanks a lot for nice comments and so many votes !!!', '2007-05-23 07:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
