(3684913, 512886, 23484, '<td valign="top">Well kick some ass.  Great shot fellow 9th place. What are the chances of that.  This shot is absolutely stunning.  I think this is better than all of the shots above you. Unfortunately, most people don''t seem to care what I think.  Excellent job.</td>', 'Well kick some ass.  Great shot fellow 9th place. What are the chances of that.  This shot is absolutely stunning.  I think this is better than all of the shots above you. Unfortunately, most people don''t seem to care what I think.  Excellent job.', '2007-05-23 09:48:25.000000', NULL, 0),
