(3685024, 512212, 70689, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, some meaningfull insights there (and compliments are always nice to receive).<br/> <br/>The score of 5.2 is about what it deserves I guess. Nothing to be greatly proud of, but at least it pushed the 4-point-somethings from my high-score list. About time to get ridd of the 5-point-somethings as well. I will have to score my first 6-point-something though :P</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, some meaningfull insights there (and compliments are always nice to receive). The score of 5.2 is about what it deserves I guess. Nothing to be greatly proud of, but at least it pushed the 4-point-somethings from my high-score list. About time to get ridd of the 5-point-somethings as well. I will have to score my first 6-point-something though :P', '2007-05-23 10:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
