(3685073, 512600, 31399, '<td valign="top">POST COMMENT:  yep it WAS/IS foggy/aka out of focus...YOU attempt a shot in murky aquarium glass with otter goin zillion miles per hour and see what you get ;-) and it IS water...and it WAS a smooth (also fast) glide..LOL...<br/> <br/>shrugs...I still love ya''ll ;-)</td>', 'POST COMMENT:  yep it WAS/IS foggy/aka out of focus...YOU attempt a shot in murky aquarium glass with otter goin zillion miles per hour and see what you get ;-) and it IS water...and it WAS a smooth (also fast) glide..LOL... shrugs...I still love ya''ll ;-)', '2007-05-23 10:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
