(3685102, 512441, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful colors and tones to this gem...<strike>congratulations on winning the blue ribbon!</strike> <i>Sorry about the DQ, still a striking photograph and one of which to be proud!</i> <br/> <br/>...and welcome to DPC!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-23 15:33:15.</i></td>', 'Very beautiful colors and tones to this gem...congratulations on winning the blue ribbon! Sorry about the DQ, still a striking photograph and one of which to be proud!  ...and welcome to DPC!', '2007-05-23 10:19:44.000000', '2007-05-23 16:33:15.000000', 0),
