(3685453, 511808, 24454, '<td valign="top">Natasha, your hair is BEAUTIFUL!  I can tell you, I would NEVER try to pass my hair off as silky smoothe :)  Maybe in a texture challenge to show all the fuzzies. . .but never like this.   I love the pretty lighting on the left side of your hair.  I''m surprised this scored 5.6.  I think it deserves much higher.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Natasha, your hair is BEAUTIFUL!  I can tell you, I would NEVER try to pass my hair off as silky smoothe :)  Maybe in a texture challenge to show all the fuzzies. . .but never like this.   I love the pretty lighting on the left side of your hair.  I''m surprised this scored 5.6.  I think it deserves much higher. ', '2007-05-23 11:18:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3685465, 512108, 59748, '<td valign="top">I speak only for myself. I do not think childish when I view the comments. I think that it is hard to put in words the feelings. Look at the shot again without feeling and as an artist. <br/> <br/>I too also thought of doing a shot quite like this. But with the model prone. Light from the side at an angle. Camera from the side. Like so many baby shots but with an adult feel. Like you said there is nothing smoother than the female skin.</td>', 'I speak only for myself. I do not think childish when I view the comments. I think that it is hard to put in words the feelings. Look at the shot again without feeling and as an artist.  I too also thought of doing a shot quite like this. But with the model prone. Light from the side at an angle. Camera from the side. Like so many baby shots but with an adult feel. Like you said there is nothing smoother than the female skin.', '2007-05-23 11:20:22.000000', NULL, 0),
