(3686549, 512490, 61311, '<td valign="top">[quote=JBHale] Hello from the Critique Club!!<br/> <br/>First of all, great composition! You put the fish in the right place in the frame and used other elements to draw attention back to it! I think the texture in this picture is great, some people may have found it hard to associate this with "Silky-Smooth," but I think it works.<br/>&lt;snip&gt;<br/> <br/>Thanks very much I do appreciate your critique.<br/>Just wanted to tell that this Koi is really silky smooth.  And yes I do pet her :-))<br/>trolljenta</td>', '[quote=JBHale] Hello from the Critique Club!! First of all, great composition! You put the fish in the right place in the frame and used other elements to draw attention back to it! I think the texture in this picture is great, some people may have found it hard to associate this with "Silky-Smooth," but I think it works.<snip> Thanks very much I do appreciate your critique.Just wanted to tell that this Koi is really silky smooth.  And yes I do pet her :-))trolljenta', '2007-05-23 14:41:51.000000', NULL, 0),
