(3686601, 512490, 61311, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by noraneko:</b></div><hr/><i> LOL - what an expression! I love these big koi! And they ARE smooth - I''ve touched one myself, before. Great entry. 8. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanks very much - you made my day :-)<br/>My Koi eats right out of my hands and I do pet them.<br/>trolljenta</td>', 'Originally posted by noraneko: LOL - what an expression! I love these big koi! And they ARE smooth - I''ve touched one myself, before. Great entry. 8.   thanks very much - you made my day :-)My Koi eats right out of my hands and I do pet them.trolljenta', '2007-05-23 14:48:53.000000', NULL, 0),
