(3686949, 512441, 22564, '<td valign="top">In another hand, the challenge was:<br/>Submission Dates:<br/>  May 9 2007 - May 15 2007<br/> <br/>And she clearly indicates that she took the picture the day before the challenge is announced, so... And on her personal site:<br/>//www.deviantart.com/deviation/54865461/?qo=22&amp;q=by%3Akatosu&amp;qh=sort%3Atime+-in%3Ascraps<br/> <br/>the picture date is 2 days before the beginning of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Good shot anyway, too bad for the timing.</td>', 'In another hand, the challenge was:Submission Dates:  May 9 2007 - May 15 2007 And she clearly indicates that she took the picture the day before the challenge is announced, so... And on her personal site://www.deviantart.com/deviation/54865461/?qo=22&q=by%3Akatosu&qh=sort%3Atime+-in%3Ascraps the picture date is 2 days before the beginning of the challenge. Good shot anyway, too bad for the timing.', '2007-05-23 15:50:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3686955, 512114, 66515, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club!<br/> <br/>Relatively good focus and good exposure. Composition is okay. The swimmer creates a "line" that takes the eye across the frame. The image is a bit "flat" because of the refraction of the water. A higher shooting position would help with this perhaps. <br/> <br/>Colors are pleasing and well saturated without going overboard. <br/> <br/>The challenge:<br/> <br/>Interesting and unique choice of topic for this challenge. When a swimmer has a good stroke it is certainly smooth though perhaps not silky in my opinion. In any event it definitely meets the challenge criteria. <br/> <br/>Good job!</td>', 'Greetings from the critique club! Relatively good focus and good exposure. Composition is okay. The swimmer creates a "line" that takes the eye across the frame. The image is a bit "flat" because of the refraction of the water. A higher shooting position would help with this perhaps.  Colors are pleasing and well saturated without going overboard.  The challenge: Interesting and unique choice of topic for this challenge. When a swimmer has a good stroke it is certainly smooth though perhaps not silky in my opinion. In any event it definitely meets the challenge criteria.  Good job!', '2007-05-23 15:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
