(3687218, 512353, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by electrolost:</b></div><hr/><i> this is a awesome image what patience it must have took to get it just right. But didn''t the same exact picture win a few times already??? just curious trying to figure this site out. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Robert, no way can you use the same picture here more than once. You have to do the picture within the given dates.<br/>I did a similar one a while back using coffee and milk. Maybe you mean that one.<br/>Thanks for commenting.</td>', 'Originally posted by electrolost: this is a awesome image what patience it must have took to get it just right. But didn''t the same exact picture win a few times already??? just curious trying to figure this site out.   Hi Robert, no way can you use the same picture here more than once. You have to do the picture within the given dates.I did a similar one a while back using coffee and milk. Maybe you mean that one.Thanks for commenting.', '2007-05-23 16:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
