(3687517, 512441, 30807, '<td valign="top">What a shame, but better luck next time!<br/> <br/>I wonder if the drop is real - surely it can''t be so perfect unless it is a glass ball, but even if it is, the idea is very nice - even the view through it is splendid.<br/> <br/>I look forward to many more successes, and the time is right for you to have them - I have the same camera, but not such a knack for a brilliant image<br/> <br/>Best of things for your future!</td>', 'What a shame, but better luck next time! I wonder if the drop is real - surely it can''t be so perfect unless it is a glass ball, but even if it is, the idea is very nice - even the view through it is splendid. I look forward to many more successes, and the time is right for you to have them - I have the same camera, but not such a knack for a brilliant image Best of things for your future!', '2007-05-23 17:36:41.000000', NULL, 0),
