(3687809, 512108, 66494, '<td valign="top">I felt the lighting was just off in the fact that it created such a harsh shadow. The shadow (and the pose angle) made it look like someone needed to cleanse themselves. Don''t mean to be offensive, just wanted to clarify on what I thought was just a tad off with the shot. <br/>Yes, skin can be very smooth and silky, the shot did not translate IMO. Otherwise, it was a good idea. (I believe I''m trying to say the same thing as Lactobeezor ... who did a better job of expression than I.)</td>', 'I felt the lighting was just off in the fact that it created such a harsh shadow. The shadow (and the pose angle) made it look like someone needed to cleanse themselves. Don''t mean to be offensive, just wanted to clarify on what I thought was just a tad off with the shot. Yes, skin can be very smooth and silky, the shot did not translate IMO. Otherwise, it was a good idea. (I believe I''m trying to say the same thing as Lactobeezor ... who did a better job of expression than I.)', '2007-05-23 18:33:14.000000', NULL, 0),
