(3689178, 511643, 57358, '<td valign="top">nice photo, the only thing I''d point out is that it seems like your camera focused on the leaf to the left side instead of the bud coming out of the water.  I love the DOF and the composition - aside from the basic editing rules, you might play around with selective blurring or dodging and burning and different coloring techniques. very nice first entry</td>', 'nice photo, the only thing I''d point out is that it seems like your camera focused on the leaf to the left side instead of the bud coming out of the water.  I love the DOF and the composition - aside from the basic editing rules, you might play around with selective blurring or dodging and burning and different coloring techniques. very nice first entry', '2007-05-24 00:38:35.000000', NULL, 0),
