(3690575, 512441, 66494, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, congrats. Hope to see you around more.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, congrats. Hope to see you around more.', '2007-05-24 11:59:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3690855, 512108, 76184, '<td valign="top">I have no issues with negative comments or critiques. That is not what chapped my ass at all. I expected a lower score, to tell the truth. I am perfectly aware that folks have different boundaries for what they consider good taste, and I can respect that. I''ll argue the pornographic claim. I''ll agree that it is more erotic, but I wouldn''t call it porn.<br/> <br/>What upset me was the cracks not at the image but at the model herself. Blast me all you want. I can take it, but one would expect a modicum of respect for the subject...a little tact, if you will. Perhaps I''m a tad more sensitive to it than others, but I tend to be protective of the ladies who offer themselves to my camera.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I have no issues with negative comments or critiques. That is not what chapped my ass at all. I expected a lower score, to tell the truth. I am perfectly aware that folks have different boundaries for what they consider good taste, and I can respect that. I''ll argue the pornographic claim. I''ll agree that it is more erotic, but I wouldn''t call it porn. What upset me was the cracks not at the image but at the model herself. Blast me all you want. I can take it, but one would expect a modicum of respect for the subject...a little tact, if you will. Perhaps I''m a tad more sensitive to it than others, but I tend to be protective of the ladies who offer themselves to my camera. ', '2007-05-24 12:56:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3690955, 512886, 62318, '<td valign="top">congrats on the score and placement. A terrific rendition of silky-smooth. Wonderful tiered compositional gives a good feeling of depth in the photo. Has a nice painterly feel to it.</td>', 'congrats on the score and placement. A terrific rendition of silky-smooth. Wonderful tiered compositional gives a good feeling of depth in the photo. Has a nice painterly feel to it.', '2007-05-24 13:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3691456, 512649, 62318, '<td valign="top">I definitely see the silky softness here. Wonderful composition. Seems a slight blue tint, not sure if that was intentional, but it doesn''t take away from the image. Terrific detail in the stamens. Magnolias are such wonderful trees and you did a superb job.<i></i></td>', 'I definitely see the silky softness here. Wonderful composition. Seems a slight blue tint, not sure if that was intentional, but it doesn''t take away from the image. Terrific detail in the stamens. Magnolias are such wonderful trees and you did a superb job.', '2007-05-24 16:13:19.000000', NULL, 0),
