(3691697, 512108, 61961, '<td valign="top">Your model should not take it personally.  Calls for her to clean or wax serve to demonstrate that a little body hair really throws people.  Maybe it''s one of the cultural dividing factors between sensual/pornographic.  Just a thought!  Peace,</td>', 'Your model should not take it personally.  Calls for her to clean or wax serve to demonstrate that a little body hair really throws people.  Maybe it''s one of the cultural dividing factors between sensual/pornographic.  Just a thought!  Peace,', '2007-05-24 17:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3691832, 512771, 57060, '<td valign="top">Obviously a very provocative photo, and one that is good for all of us to experience. Technically it''s not too sound (IMO) but that''s not always important. Keep taking pictures that your mind and heart tell you to, that''s what it''s about, not a score.<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Obviously a very provocative photo, and one that is good for all of us to experience. Technically it''s not too sound (IMO) but that''s not always important. Keep taking pictures that your mind and heart tell you to, that''s what it''s about, not a score. Jack', '2007-05-24 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 0),
