(3692740, 511959, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Andy,<br/>       Nice effort white is tough sometimes. I do believe you are a bit out of focus &amp; a touch over exposed. The red rose is out of place &amp; your crop made it worse. Also the top right corner the glear is really distracting.</td>', 'Hi Andy,       Nice effort white is tough sometimes. I do believe you are a bit out of focus & a touch over exposed. The red rose is out of place & your crop made it worse. Also the top right corner the glear is really distracting.', '2007-05-24 23:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3693324, 512353, 78970, '<td valign="top">I am in disbelief as well... I registered on this site just to put a comment on this incredibly perfect shot. Mother nature is so perfect that makes me think of American Beauty when they say that sometimes there is so much beauty that it hurts...</td>', 'I am in disbelief as well... I registered on this site just to put a comment on this incredibly perfect shot. Mother nature is so perfect that makes me think of American Beauty when they say that sometimes there is so much beauty that it hurts...', '2007-05-25 01:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
