(3712916, 511335, 60862, '<td valign="top">Well, first, congrats on meeting your goal! :)  I like the shapes you created, and the dark part in the lower right is placed well to draw my attention.  I think the other commenters are right that a little more light in there would give me something to see when my attention goes there.  Even shining a flashlight in there would help.  Finally, congrats on your new 3rd-best score!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-30 02:47:54.</i></td>', 'Well, first, congrats on meeting your goal! :)  I like the shapes you created, and the dark part in the lower right is placed well to draw my attention.  I think the other commenters are right that a little more light in there would give me something to see when my attention goes there.  Even shining a flashlight in there would help.  Finally, congrats on your new 3rd-best score!', '2007-05-30 03:46:37.000000', '2007-05-30 03:47:54.000000', 0),
(3713933, 512197, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m so sorry to see you were disqualified.  You are right, there will be other challenges.  You''ve got some fine work in your portfolio, so keep it up and you''ll rise to the top again.<br/>Cheers,<br/> -- Larry in NYC</td>', 'I''m so sorry to see you were disqualified.  You are right, there will be other challenges.  You''ve got some fine work in your portfolio, so keep it up and you''ll rise to the top again.Cheers, -- Larry in NYC', '2007-05-30 11:16:32.000000', NULL, 0),
