(3734229, 511808, 67145, '<td valign="top">tashy ... you have gorgeous hair!! .. &amp; i really like this photograph .. i love the way the your skin in the dress forms a sort of ''v'' pointing to the bottom of the image, and how the dress blends into the black background .. i reckon that''s awesome ... <br/>interesting how different ppl see different things .. like the critique says that''s a bad thing .. i totally disagree!!! .. i love how the dress forms a negative space which flows into the background ... just EXCELLENT .. :):)x</td>', 'tashy ... you have gorgeous hair!! .. & i really like this photograph .. i love the way the your skin in the dress forms a sort of ''v'' pointing to the bottom of the image, and how the dress blends into the black background .. i reckon that''s awesome ... interesting how different ppl see different things .. like the critique says that''s a bad thing .. i totally disagree!!! .. i love how the dress forms a negative space which flows into the background ... just EXCELLENT .. :):)x', '2007-06-03 23:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
