(3773867, 511335, 62787, '<td valign="top">What a lovely picture. I swear I can feel the soft, smooth texture just from looking at it. The shadows and highlights work perfectly, and there are so many nice curvy lines for the eye to follow, you can just get lost in this picture for ages.<br/> <br/>Oh wow, just read through the comments, and only just noticed the woman reaching out for the heart. But she''s so there!</td>', 'What a lovely picture. I swear I can feel the soft, smooth texture just from looking at it. The shadows and highlights work perfectly, and there are so many nice curvy lines for the eye to follow, you can just get lost in this picture for ages. Oh wow, just read through the comments, and only just noticed the woman reaching out for the heart. But she''s so there!', '2007-06-12 17:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
